"Disks is performing one or more operations. Closing the app will cancel them."
msgstr ""
"Diskar utfører éin eller fleire operasjonar. Lukkar du appen, vert dei "
"avbrotne."

#: src/disks/gdu-application.c:100
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Lukk"

